    <string name="hamlet_a_help_text">Build your village and send a team of heroes into the wilds. Two heroes protect the front line; the others attack and heal from behind. Grove counters Forge, Forge counters Dawn, Dawn counters Grove. Three or four heroes of one faction give a team bonus; named bonds add specific effects.\nEarn food, books, ore, fragments and tickets by exploring, fighting and farming. Recruit available heroes of your choice with three tickets, or rescue them on the route. Four skills, four gear pieces and awakening traits add different strengths. Complete equipment sets grant mastery.\nEvery attempt is free. Defeated heroes recover immediately. Pause, change the team and replay cleared encounters to gather supplies. After the six regions, the journey keeps going with new enemies and higher rewards. No energy, daily attempt limits, purchases or real-money speed-ups. Your village keeps producing while you are away.</string>
